<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Sevel posts $17.4 mln net.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Sevel posts $17.4 mln net.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months ended Sept 30</p>
<p>Net $17.4 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>Note: The carmaker said the net included an extraordinary loss of $21.6 million. Comparative or Q3 figures unavailable. Full name is Sevel Argentina SA. Net assets were $392 million.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 3180668</p>
</text>
